<title>UK: Barclays appoints planning director.</title>
<headline>Barclays appoints planning director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Plc said it has appointed Graham Pimlott as its director of planning, operations and technology with effect from early next year.</p>
<p>Pimlott, who is currently chief executive of the merchant banking division of Barclays' investment banking arm BZW, will be in charge of strategic planning.</p>
<p>Pimlott has been head of corporate finance at BZW and was in charge of Barclays' corporate and institutional banking group. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
